{"suttaId":"sn22.41","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-iii","vriCode":"s0303m.mul","paras":[206,206],"vripara":"41"},"segments":{"sn22.41:0.3":"Tatiyaanudhammasuttaṃ","sn22.41:1.1":"Sāvatthinidānaṃ.","sn22.41:1.2":"“Dhammānudhammappaṭipannassa, bhikkhave, bhikkhuno ayamanudhammo hoti yaṃ rūpe dukkhānupassī vihareyya … pe …","sn22.41:1.3":"parimuccati dukkhasmāti vadāmī”ti.","sn22.41:1.4":"Navamaṃ."},"unsure":[],"attha":{"book":"Spk-iii","bookName":"Khandhavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0303a.att","from":107,"to":110,"paras":[{"para":107,"vripara":"39-42","refs":["sn22.41:1"],"lines":["39-42. Sattame <b>dhammānudhammappaṭipannassā</b>ti navannaṃ lokuttaradhammānaṃ anulomadhammaṃ pubbabhāgapaṭipadaṃ paṭipannassa.","<b>Ayamanudhammo</b>ti ayaṃ anulomadhammo hoti.","<b>Nibbidābahulo</b>ti ukkaṇṭhanabahulo hutvā.","<b>Parijānātī</b>ti tīhi pariññāhi parijānāti.","<b>Parimuccatī</b>ti maggakkhaṇe uppannāya pahānapariññāya parimuccati.","Evaṃ imasmiṃ sutte maggova kathito hoti, tathā ito paresu tīsu.","Idha pana anupassanā aniyamitā, tesu niyamitā.","Tasmā idhāpi sā tattha niyamitavaseneva niyametabbā.","Na hi sakkā tīsu aññataraṃ anupassanaṃ vinā nibbindituṃ parijānituṃ vāti.","Sattamādīni."],"lineRefs":[["sn22.41:1"],["sn22.41:1"],["sn22.41:1"],["sn22.41:1"],["sn22.41:1"],["sn22.41:1"],["sn22.41:1"],["sn22.41:1"],["sn22.41:1"],["sn22.41:1"]]},{"para":108,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.41:1"],"lines":["Natumhākavaggo catuttho."],"lineRefs":[["sn22.41:1"]]},{"para":109,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.41:1"],"lines":["Attadīpavaggo"],"lineRefs":[["sn22.41:1"]]},{"para":110,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.41:1"],"lines":["Attadīpasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn22.41:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-iii","bookName":"Khandhavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0303t.tik","from":106,"to":110,"paras":[{"para":106,"vripara":"39-42","refs":["sn22.41:1"],"lines":["39-42. Apāyadukkhe sakalasaṃsāradukkhe ca patituṃ adatvā dhāraṇaṭṭhena dhammo, maggaphalanibbānāni.","Tadanulomikā cassa pubbabhāgapaṭipadāti āha <b>“dhammānudhammapaṭipannassā”</b>tiādi.","“Nibbidābahulo”ti aṭṭhakathāyaṃ paduddhāro kato, pāḷiyaṃ pana “nibbidābahulaṃ vihareyyā”ti āgataṃ.","<b>Ukkaṇṭhanabahulo</b>ti sabbabhavesu ukkaṇṭhanabahulo.","<b>Tīhi pariññāhī</b>ti ñātatīraṇappahānapariññāhi.","<b>Parijānātī</b>ti tebhūmakadhamme paricchijja jānāti, vipassanaṃ ussukkāpeti.","<b>Parimuccati</b> sabbasaṃkilesato “maggo pavattito parimuccatī”ti vuttattā.","<b>Tathā</b>ti iminā ito paresu tīsu maggo hotīti dasseti.","<b>Idhā</b>ti imasmiṃ sutte.","<b>Aniyamitā</b>ti aggahitā.","<b>Tesu niyamitā</b> “aniccānupassī”tiādivacanato.","<b>Sā</b>ti anupassanā.","<b>Tattha niyamitavasenevā</b>ti idaṃ lakkhaṇavacanaṃ yathā “yadi me byādhayo bhaveyyuṃ, dātabbamidamosadhan”ti.","Na hi sakkā etissā eva anupassanāya vasena sammasanācāraṃ matthakaṃ pāpetunti."],"lineRefs":[["sn22.41:1"],["sn22.41:1"],["sn22.41:1"],["sn22.41:1"],["sn22.41:1"],["sn22.41:1"],["sn22.41:1"],["sn22.41:1"],["sn22.41:1"],["sn22.41:1"],["sn22.41:1"],["sn22.41:1"],["sn22.41:1"],["sn22.41:1"]]},{"para":107,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.41:1"],"lines":["Anudhammasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn22.41:1"]]},{"para":108,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.41:1"],"lines":["Natumhākaṃvaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn22.41:1"]]},{"para":109,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.41:1"],"lines":["Attadīpavaggo"],"lineRefs":[["sn22.41:1"]]},{"para":110,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.41:1"],"lines":["Attadīpasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn22.41:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
